    "sections": {
        "description": "Woodworker WordPress Theme has been crafted for carpenters into business of making, repairing, polishing, and upholstering of wooden furniture, cabinets and other wooden articles and things. Whether the woodworker has a workshop from where they take orders and supply furniture to various customers; owns a furniture showroom, work with interior designers, takes wooden furniture repair or carpentery work, or any other Carpenter related workmanship - this theme will work for people engaged in any of these craftsmanship work. The theme is neat and aesthetically pleasing, in line with furniture business to attract and compel customers to stop by and consider enquiring or doing business with you. This Woodworker WordPress Theme has neatly divided sections in each of which you can place images and information as per business requirements. Woodwork is an engaging, time taking, and a creative occupation. So you need an online shop that will neither take too much of your time nor expense to maintain it. And Woodworker WordPress Theme offers you this super convenience You can place images and content yourself, without hiring and spending on additional manpower to maintain your online shop. Woodworker WordPress Theme comes with an easy to use Dashboard which has all the easy to follow instruction buttons using which you can change images, update content, to make announcements etc. in real time, that too quickly. We’ve also ensured that besides being easy to maintain, the theme is also responsive so that your potential customer no matter which device they visit you through (mobile, laptop, desktop, tab), your woodwork WordPress theme can be viewed flawlessly without any disturbance. One close look at the Woodworker WordPress Theme will tell you of the thought that has gone behind crafting it to ensure it helps the business owner stand out and compete in the market. Live Demo: https://www.luzukdemo.com/demo/woodworker/"
    },
